          "text": "---\nname: Shopify refund policy path\ndescription: On a Shopify store the refund policy is at /policies/refund-policy\ntype: reference\nstatus: superseded\nsuperseded_by: try-policies-refund-policy-first.md\n---\nShopify stores serve their refund policy at `/policies/refund-policy`.\n\n`/pages/returns` and `/pages/refund-policy` were empty on Taylor Stitch: they hold a returns portal, not the policy.\n",
